  "grammar": {
    "intro": "Substantive adjectives; declension systems; velar and dental stems; reflexive pronouns. Work through each section, use its checks and topic practice, then complete the grammar exercises. Reading-only forms remain supported by glosses.",
    "objectives": [
      "Interpret adjectives used as nouns for people or things.",
      "Use dictionary nominative, genitive, and article to establish stem, declension, and gender.",
