          "prompt": "εἶμι περὶ τῆς σωτηρίας ἐρωτήσων.",
          "answer": "I shall go to ask about safety (adapted learner statement). — εἶμι and εἰμί"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "πολίτης εἰμί.",
          "answer": "I am a citizen (supplementary example). — εἶμι and εἰμί"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "ὁ Κλεόκριτος ἔρχεται ἀγγελῶν τὴν γνώμην.",
          "answer": "Cleocritus comes to announce his judgment (adapted purpose wording). — Future Participles Expressing Purpose"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "ἡ γυνὴ ἔρχεται ἐρωτήσουσα.",
          "answer": "The woman comes to ask (supplementary example). — Future Participles Expressing Purpose"
        },
        {
          "prompt": "δεῖ τὴν πατρίδα σῴζειν.",
          "answer": "It is necessary to save the homeland. — δεῖ and χρή with an Infinitive"
