    "intro": "Use the story to identify who acts and how the action is presented. The following 5 sections teach each assigned topic separately, with forms, worked examples, checks, and practice.",
    "objectives": [
      "Aorist indicative in past narrative: explain the pattern and interpret its worked examples.",
      "Thematic second aorist: active and middle: explain the pattern and interpret its worked examples.",
      "Aspect: action viewed as a whole: explain the pattern and interpret its worked examples.",
      "Active and middle aorist participles: explain the pattern and interpret its worked examples.",
      "Common second aorists and principal parts: explain the pattern and interpret its worked examples."
