        "prompt": "When are fifty horsemen accepted?",
        "answer": "on the following day. The source separates the night’s slingers and next day’s cavalry."
      },
      {
        "prompt": "What does Socrates’s comparison emphasize?",
        "answer": "the welfare of those led. Memorabilia evaluates command through followers’ well-being."
      },
